We thank the reviewer's suggestive feedback and the recognition for the additional work we did. Based on the reviewer's final thought, in the final paper we will 

1) clearly state the difference between our work and previous work; 

2) summarize all concurrent works presented in NeurIPS 2021 and ICLR 2022 submissions (there are 2 papers being similar to ours, mentioned by Reviewer oHnh) ; 

3) revise Proposition 2 accordingly, as the reviewer's comment is more precise;

4) include plain GNN-AK's result in all the tables;

5) use 500k-params constraint on the ZINC dataset. 

We will also open source our code soon. Thank you again for your time on the review.
